    "description": "The Ecommerce Cart Saves API allows users to access and retrieve saved items from a shopping cart within the ecommerce platform. This endpoint is particularly useful for applications that need to display previously saved cart content to customers, enabling them to easily revisit and complete their purchases. Typical consumers include frontend applications, mobile apps, and integration services that enhance the shopping experience. Developers can utilize this API to create features that remind users of their saved items, facilitating a smoother checkout process.",
